          {
            "type": "HTML",
            "data": "<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<p>Now you proceed to ingest the catalog data that is stored in Amazon S3.  This is a three-step process.<br />\nIn the first step (step 4.1.3), you create and define an in-memory table to read the catalog data from Amazon S3.<br />\nIn the second step (step 4.1.4), you create and define an in-memory table for the Kinesis data stream that will ingest the catalog data.<br />\nIn the third step (step 4.1.5), you insert the data into the Kinesis data stream.</p>\n\n</div>"
          }
        ]
      },
      "apps": [],
